The first theorem identifies the precise floor and signed mean equivalent to the original HeightAt. The second and third prove the cloud lower bound and the node difference upper bound using the original divided rows. The Chow test, the bounds on harmonic sections, the two-sided parallel twist and the CM period comparison are paper proofs in sections/recorded-height-input.tex.
